{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "866b193b-3ff7-81bd-b473-d5fe08b42b0d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T13:52:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Angela Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:50:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. My name is Angela Ricci. I am calling about the trash and the recycling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Angela. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the holiday week, I want to know the new schedule. The pickup day, is it changed? I am not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "174 Coggeshall Avenue. In Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "174 Coggeshall. Alright. Usually when there's a holiday during the week, pickup slides back a day for the rest of that week. So this week, anything after the holiday would've been a day late. Did your pickup get missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, can you say again? Slide back a day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Your normal day gets pushed one day later. So if you're normally Thursday, it'd be Friday that week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. Thursday is my day. So it is today, Friday, this week. My bins are outside since yesterday and nobody comes yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. They may still be running behind, it's been a heavy week. They could come later this afternoon. Next week should be back to your regular day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next week, regular day. Thursday. I understand. But I want a supervisor to call me back, please. I want to ask about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. I'll leave a message for a supervisor in the department. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0153."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-three. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Please call in the afternoon, if possible. My daughter is learning the violin, and the practice squeaks through the wall. It is hard to talk in the house when she plays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, understood. I'll note afternoon, and that you're at 174 Coggeshall about the late pickup and the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you very much. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Angela. Someone will get back to you. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T13:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
